msgstr "Pakua faili ya .mo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/LanguageOverridesPanel.php:201
msgid ""
"Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern "
"{textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing "
"one will replace it."
msgstr ""
"Inakubali faili zilizokusanywa za .mo pekee. Jina la faili lazima zifuate "
"muundo wa {textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Kupakia faili lenye jina sawa na la "
"zamani kutalibadilisha."

