msgstr "✓ Imo — lebo za eneo pekee (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:155
msgid "✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards"
msgstr "✓ Imo — OG kamili + Kadi za Twitter"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:160
msgid ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set "
"to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You "
"can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Mu-plugin wa zamani wa lf-social-share umegunduliwa. LF inahifadhi seti ya "
"OG ya msingi kwa mu-plugin na inatoa og:locale + og:locale:alternate tu. "
"Unaweza kuzima mu-plugin — Social Share iliyojengwa ndani ya LF (SEO → "
"Social Share tab) na Cover ya Open Graph zinafanya kazi sawa."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of SEO plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"SEO plugin(s) detected: %s. LF is outputting og:locale and og:locale:"
"alternate only; the detected plugin handles the full OG set."
msgstr ""
"Programu-jalizi(zi) za SEO zilizogunduliwa: %s. LF inatoa og:locale na og:"
"locale:alternate pekee; programu-jalizi iliyogunduliwa inashughulikia seti "
"kamili ya OG."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:178
msgid ""
"No external OG plugin detected. LF is outputting the full OG + Twitter Card "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna plugin ya OG ya nje iliyogunduliwa. LF inatoa seti kamili ya OG + "
"Twitter Card."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/OpenGraphPanel.php:187
msgid "Save Open Graph Settings"
msgstr "Hifadhi Mipangilio ya Open Graph"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:50
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge outputs Schema.org JSON-LD structured data so search engines "
"understand your content type, language, and metadata. This is the primary "
"way to communicate inLanguage annotations for multilingual content to Google "
"and other crawlers."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge hutoa data iliyopangwa ya Schema.org JSON-LD ili injini za "
"utafutaji kuelewa aina ya maudhui yako, lugha, na metadata. Hii ndiyo njia "
"kuu ya kuwasiliana maelezo ya inLanguage kwa Google na wakusanyaji wengine."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:60
msgid "Schema output deferred."
msgstr "Matokeo ya Schema yameahirishwa."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SchemaPanel.php:64
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s is active and already outputs Schema.org JSON-LD. Lingua Forge has "
"disabled its own schema output to prevent conflicting graphs. Unlike Open "
"Graph — where LF adds og:locale on top of another plugin's output — schema "
"cannot be cleanly supplemented: duplicate or overlapping JSON-LD graphs "
"produce validation errors. Disable schema output in the detected plugin if "
"you want LF to handle structured data."
msgstr ""
"%s ni hai na tayari inatoa Schema.org JSON-LD. Lingua Forge imezima toleo "
"lake la schema ili kuzuia michoro inayopingana. Tofauti na Open Graph — "
"ambapo LF huongeza og:locale juu ya toleo la plugin nyingine — schema "
"haiwezi kuongezwa kwa usafi: michoro ya JSON-LD inayojirudia au inayokinzana "
"husababisha makosa ya uthibitishaji. Zima toleo la schema kwenye plugin "
"iliyogunduliwa ikiwa unataka LF kushughulikia data iliyowekwa muundo."

