#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:46
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge generates a dedicated XML sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml that adds "
"language alternate links for all your translated content. This sitemap "
"complements the WordPress core sitemap and any SEO plugin sitemap — it does "
"not replace them."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge hutoa ramani ya tovuti ya XML iliyojitenga kwenye /lf-sitemap."
"xml ambayo huongeza viungo vya lugha mbadala kwa maudhui yako yote "
"yaliyotafsiriwa. Ramani hii ya tovuti inaambatana na ramani ya tovuti ya "
"WordPress na ramani ya tovuti ya plugin yoyote ya SEO — haitabadilishi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:54
msgid ""
"The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells "
"search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link "
"hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage."
msgstr ""
"Ramani ya tovuti ya msingi ya WordPress inaorodhesha URL zote za maudhui "
"yako. Ramani ya tovuti ya LF inawaambia injini za utafutaji jinsi toleo za "
"lugha zinavyohusiana kwa njia ya xhtml:link hreflang mbadala. Wasilisha zote "
"kwa Google Search Console kwa ufanisi kamili."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:67
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s is active and generates its own sitemap. That sitemap is separate from "
"LF's. Both should be submitted to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin "
"sitemap lists your content; the LF sitemap adds the multilingual alternate "
"links. LF's sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically."
msgstr ""
"%s ni hai na inazalisha ramani yake ya tovuti. Ramani hiyo ni tofauti na ya "
