"Settings → Connectors). If translation fails, check the PHP error log for "
"the specific error, or switch to a built-in provider."
msgstr ""
"Tafsiri ya kurasa kamili hutumia matokeo yaliyo na muundo wa JSON-schema. "
"Hii inahitaji kiambatishi cha kiunganishi kusakinishwa na kuwa hai (si tu "
