msgid ""
"How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source "
"term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim."
msgstr ""
"Jinsi inapaswa kuonekana katika tafsiri. Andika thamani ile ile na neno la "
"chanzo ili kuagiza AI kuilinda kwa maneno halisi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:232
msgid "— Any source language —"
msgstr "— Yoyote ya lugha ya chanzo —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:237
msgid ""
"Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be "
"enforced regardless of which language we are translating from."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu kwa majina ya chapa na maneno yasiyotegemea lugha ambayo yanapaswa "
"kutekelezwa bila kujali lugha tunayotafsiri kutoka."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:246
msgid "— Any target language —"
msgstr "— Yoyote ya lugha ya malengo —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:251
msgid ""
"Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand "
"names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every "
"translation."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu ili kiingilio hiki kiweze kutumika kwa lugha zote za malengo — "
"bora kwa majina ya chapa, kifupi, na maneno yanayopaswa kuhifadhiwa kwa "
"maneno halisi katika kila tafsiri."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:260
msgid ""
"Optional context for editors (e.g. \"ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated "
"Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts\")."
msgstr ""
"Muktadha wa hiari kwa wahariri (kama vile \"ASIC = Circuit ya Maombi "
"Mahususi; ihifadhi kwa Kiingereza katika muktadha wa kiufundi\")."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:265
msgid "Add entry"
msgstr "Ongeza kiingilio"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:22
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:715
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Mipaka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:39
msgid "Authors and above (edit_published_posts)"
msgstr "Waandishi na zaidi (hariri_maandishi_yaliyochapwa)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:40
msgid "Contributors and above — default (edit_posts)"
msgstr "Wachangia na zaidi — chaguo-msingi (hariri_maandishi)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:41
msgid "Editors and above (edit_others_posts)"
msgstr "Wahariri na zaidi (hariri_wa_waandishi_wengine)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:42
msgid "Administrators only (manage_options)"
msgstr "Wasimamizi pekee (simamia_mipangilio)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:52
msgid "AI Limits & Security"
msgstr "Mipaka na Usalama wa AI"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:56
msgid ""
"Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles "
"may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 "
"requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user "
"runaway loops."
msgstr ""
"Kataza kiasi cha matumizi ya AI kinachoweza kuzalishwa na tovuti na kuzuia "
"majukumu ya watumiaji wanaoweza kuanzisha simu za AI zilipwa. Inachukua "
"nafasi ya kikomo cha kila mtumiaji (ombi 30 / dakika, kilichowekwa kwa "
"nguvu) kinacholinda dhidi ya mizunguko ya kipekee ya mtumiaji."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:65
msgid "Daily request limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha maombi ya kila siku"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:80
msgid ""
"Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar "
"translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 "
"to disable the cap."
msgstr ""
"Kikomo cha tovuti kwa maombi ya AI kwa siku ya UTC (kinahesabu tafsiri za "
"Zana na marekebisho ya kizuizi). Kiwango kinarejeshwa saa sita usiku wa UTC. "
"Weka 0 ili kuzima kikomo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:89
msgid "Minimum role"
msgstr "Hali ya chini"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:109
msgid ""
"Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this "
"on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running "
"paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"Uwezo wa WordPress wa chini kabisa unaoruhusiwa kuanzisha vipengele vya AI. "
"Kuimarisha hili kwenye tovuti za waandishi wengi kunazuia Wachangia au "
"akaunti za majaribio kuendesha simu za AI zilipwa. Pitia kwa kila kipengele "
"kupitia kichujio cha \"linguaforge_required_capability\"."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:118
msgid "Translation Limits"
msgstr "Mipaka ya Tafsiri"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:122
msgid ""
"Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can "
"be. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). "
"Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce "
"API costs."
msgstr ""
"Dhibiti kiasi cha maudhui yanayopitishwa kwa AI na ukubwa wa majibu "
"yanayoweza kutolewa. Acha uwanja tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi cha ndani "
"(kinachoonyeshwa kama mahali pa kuweka). Ongeza thamani hizi ikiwa kurasa "
"kubwa zinakatwa; punguza ili kupunguza gharama za API."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:131
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:225
msgid "Model tier"
msgstr "Kiwango cha mfano"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:143
msgid "Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr "Ubora (chaguo-msingi — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:146
msgid "Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)"
msgstr "Mwanga (haraka na nafuu — Haiku / Flash)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:151
msgid ""
"Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model "
"configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-"
"form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and "
"the content is short."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha mfano kinachotumika kwa tafsiri ya kurasa kamili. Ubora unatumia "
"mfano uliowekwa kwenye jedwali la Miundo hapo juu na ni wa kupendekezwa kwa "
"tafsiri sahihi, ya muda mrefu. Badilisha kwa Mwanga ikiwa ni haraka au "
"gharama ndogo ndogo ndizo kipaumbele na maudhui ni mafupi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:160
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:254
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:315
msgid "Max output tokens"
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni za matokeo makubwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:177
msgid ""
"Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation "
"response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this "
"value. Default: 16 000."
msgstr ""
"Idadi kubwa ya tokeni ambazo AI inaweza kuzalisha kwa jibu moja la tafsiri. "
"Ikiwa tafsiri inakatwa kimya kimya mwisho, ongeza thamani hii. Chaguo-"
"msingi: 16,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:186
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:278
msgid "Max input characters"
msgstr "Herufi za ingizo za juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:203
msgid ""
"Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no "
"limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value "
"only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to "
"the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango kikubwa cha wahusika wa maudhui ya chapisho yaliyotumwa kwa AI. 0 "
"inamaanisha hakuna kikomo — maudhui kamili yanatumiwa daima (inapendekezwa). "
"Weka thamani isiyo sifuri ikiwa mtoa huduma wako ana dirisha la muktadha "
"mkali. Onyo linaandikwa kwenye kumbukumbu ya makosa ya PHP kila wakati "
"maudhui yanapunguzwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:212
msgid "Quick Translation"
msgstr "Tafsiri Haraka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:216
msgid ""
"Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated "
"on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, "
"lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast "
"and cost-effective."
msgstr ""
"Tafsiri Haraka hutumiwa kwa hali ya vipande/vipande — vifungu vifupi "
"vinavyotafsiriwa kwa ombi kutoka kwa upau wa zana, mhariri, au popo za "
"kizuizi. Inatumia usanidi tofauti, nyepesi kutoka kwa tafsiri ya ukurasa "
"kamili ili kuweka majibu kuwa ya haraka na yenye gharama nafuu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:237
msgid "Light (default — fast and cost-effective)"
msgstr "Nuru (chaguo-msingi — haraka na yenye gharama nafuu)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:240
msgid "Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr "Ubora (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:245
msgid ""
"The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above "
"(default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation "
"accuracy as full-page mode for snippets."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha Nuru kinatumia mfano wa haraka uliowekwa kwenye jedwali la "
"Miundo hapo juu (chaguo-msingi: Haiku / Flash). Badilisha kwa Ubora ikiwa "
"unahitaji usahihi wa tafsiri sawa na hali ya ukurasa kamili kwa vipande."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:270
msgid ""
"Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaowezekana na AI inaweza kuzalisha kwa kila tafsiri "
"ya haraka. Chagua: 2,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:294
msgid "Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaokubaliwa kutoka kwa uwanja wa ingizo. Chaguo-"
"msingi: 8,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:302
msgid "Content Generator"
msgstr "Kizazi cha Maudhui"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:306
msgid ""
"Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator "
"feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults."
msgstr ""
"Hudhibiti bajeti ya tokeni na mipaka ya ingizo kwa kipengele cha Kizazi cha "
"Maudhui cha AI. Acha mashamba tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi zilizojengwa "
"ndani."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:331
msgid ""
"Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full "
"articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaowezekana na AI wanaweza kuzalisha kwa kila "
"uendeshaji wa kizazi. Ongeza ikiwa makala kamili yanakatwa. Chaguo-msingi: "
"8,192."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:339
msgid "Max hints characters"
msgstr "Wahusika wa vidokezo vya juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:355
msgid "Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaosomwa kutoka kwa uwanja wa Vidokezo. Chaguo-"
"msingi: 2,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:363
msgid "Max context characters"
msgstr "Wahusika wa muktadha wa juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:379
msgid ""
"Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context "
"when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wa maudhui ya chapisho yaliyopo yanayotumwa kwa AI "
"kama muktadha wa mbegu wakati hakuna Vidokezo vinavyotolewa. Chaguo-msingi: "
"6,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:31
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:177
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:721
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Matengenezo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:41
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:96 ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:717
msgid "Router"
msgstr "Router"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:97
msgid "Primary language saved."
msgstr "Lugha kuu imehifadhiwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:102
msgid "Permalink rules flushed successfully."
msgstr "Sheri za permalink zimefutwa kwa mafanikio."

#. translators: %d: number of posts deleted
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "Language uninstalled. %d post deleted."
msgid_plural "Language uninstalled. %d posts deleted."
msgstr[0] "Lugha imeondolewa. Chapisho %d kimefutwa."
msgstr[1] "Lugha imeondolewa. Machapisho %d yamefutwa."

#. translators: %d: number of locale files removed
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:123
#, php-format
msgid "%d locale file removed."
msgid_plural "%d locale files removed."
msgstr[0] "Faili %d za lugha zimetolewa."
msgstr[1] "Faili %d za lugha zimetolewa."

#. translators: %d: number of CPT block pattern translations removed
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:130
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid "%d pattern translation removed."
msgid_plural "%d pattern translations removed."
msgstr[0] "Ufasirishwa kwa mfano umeshindwa."
msgstr[1] "Ufasirishwa kwa mfano umeshindwa."

#. translators: %d: number of locale files that could not be removed
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:141
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%d locale file could not be removed automatically (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is "
"set). Delete it manually via your server or WP-CLI: wp language core "
"uninstall <locale>"
msgid_plural ""
"%d locale files could not be removed automatically (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is "
"set). Delete them manually via your server or WP-CLI: wp language core "
"uninstall <locale>"
msgstr[0] ""
"Faili %d za lugha haziwezi kufutwa kiotomatiki (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS "
"imewashwa). Futa kwa mikono kupitia seva yako au WP-CLI: wp language core "
"uninstall <locale>."
msgstr[1] ""
"Faili %d za lugha haziwezi kufutwa kiotomatiki (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS "
"imewashwa). Futa kwa mikono kupitia seva yako au WP-CLI: wp language core "
"uninstall <locale>."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:207
msgid "Primary Language"
msgstr "Lugha Kuu"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:210
msgid ""
"The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL "
"prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other "
"languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a "
"language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure "
"setting below."
msgstr ""
"Lugha kuu daima hutumika kwenye mzizi wa tovuti yako — hakuna kiambishi cha "
"URL katika hali ya njia, hakuna subdomain ya lugha katika hali ya subdomain. "
"Lugha nyingine zote hutumia au kiambishi cha /lang/ (mfano example.com/de/) "
"au subdomain ya lugha (mfano de.example.com), kulingana na mpangilio wa "
"muundo wa URL hapo chini."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:221
msgid "Primary language"
msgstr "Lugha kuu"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:233
msgid ""
"After changing the primary language, flush permalinks (section below) for "
"the URL routing to update."
msgstr ""
"Baada ya kubadilisha lugha kuu, safisha permalink (sehemu chini) ili "
"kusasisha njia ya URL."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:246
msgid "Path prefix — example.com/de/"
msgstr "Kipindi cha njia — example.com/de/"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:249
msgid "Subdomain — de.example.com/"
msgstr "Subdomain — de.example.com/"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:253
msgid ""
"Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e."
"g. de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, "
"flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e."
"g. www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex "
"domain so subdomains are constructed correctly."
msgstr ""
"Mode ya subdomain inahitaji seva yako ya wavuti kuelekeza subdomains zote za "
"lugha (kama de.example.com) kwa usakinishaji huu wa WordPress. Baada ya "
"kubadilisha mode, fanya usafi wa sheria za permalink na safisha cache "
"yoyote. Ikiwa URL yako ya nyumbani inajumuisha www (kama www.example.com), "
"tumia kichujio cha lf_base_domain kuweka domain kuu bila www ili subdomains "
"zifanywe kwa usahihi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:259
msgid "Browser language redirect"
msgstr "Uelekeaji wa lugha wa kivinjari"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:269
msgid ""
"Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser's Accept-"
"Language header"
msgstr ""
"Uelekeza wageni kwa lugha yao wanayoipendelea kulingana na kichwa cha Accept-"
"Language cha kivinjari"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:272
msgid ""
"When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language "
"prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. "
"The redirect is skipped if the browser's preferred language is not among the "
"active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, "
"the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future "
"visits."
msgstr ""
"Wakati kinachozimwa, wageni wa mara ya kwanza wasio na keki ya lugha na bila "
"kiambishi cha lugha kwenye URL wanapelekwa kwa toleo la lugha linalolingana "
"zaidi. Uelekezaji huachwa ikiwa lugha inayopendelewa na kivinjari si "
"miongoni mwa lugha zinazofanya kazi za router. Mara mgeni anapochagua lugha "
"kupitia kisakinishi, keki inachukua kipaumbele na kichwa cha kivinjari "
"hakitazingatiwa kwa ziara zijazo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:279
msgid "Query Filter Exclusions"
msgstr "Kujumuisha kwa Kichujio cha Maswali"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:282
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge scopes secondary WP_Query instances (sidebar widgets, template "
"blocks, plugin lookups) to the active language by injecting a _lf_lang meta "
"constraint. Post types listed here are excluded from that constraint — their "
"queries are always unfiltered."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge inazingatia nakala za WP_Query za pili (vidirisha vya upande, "
"vijiti vya template, utafutaji wa programu-jalizi) kwa lugha hai kwa "
"kuingiza vigezo vya meta _lf_lang. Aina za machapisho zilizoorodheshwa hapa "
"hazijumuishwi na vigezo hivyo — maswali yao daima hayajachujwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:286
msgid ""
"Contact Form 7 (wpcf7_contact_form), Flamingo contacts and inbound messages "
"(flamingo_contact, flamingo_inbound), and WordPress language-pack sync "
"storage (wp_sync_storage) are excluded automatically. Add any other third-"
"party post types whose content should not be language-filtered, one per line "
"or comma-separated."
msgstr ""
"Fomu ya Mawasiliano 7 (wpcf7_contact_form), mawasiliano ya Flamingo na "
"ujumbe wa kuingia (flamingo_contact, flamingo_inbound), na usawazishaji wa "
"pakiti la lugha la WordPress (wp_sync_storage) yanachukuliwa kiotomati. "
"Ongeza aina nyingine za machapisho za watu wa tatu ambazo maudhui yao "
"hayapaswi kupitiwa kwa lugha, moja kwa mstari au kwa koma."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:294
msgid "Excluded post types"
msgstr "Aina za machapisho zilizozuiwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:306
msgid ""
"Post type slugs separated by commas or newlines. Changes take effect "
"immediately on save — no permalink flush required."
msgstr ""
"Majina ya aina ya chapisho yanayotenganishwa kwa koma au mistari mipya. "
"Mabadiliko yanachukua athari mara moja wakati wa kuhifadhi — hakuhitaji "
"kufuta permalink."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:315
msgid "WooCommerce Integration"
msgstr "Ujumuishaji wa WooCommerce"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:318
msgid "Controls how Lingua Forge integrates with WooCommerce order processing."
msgstr ""
"Hii inaamua jinsi Lingua Forge inavyoshirikiana na usindikaji wa oda za "
"WooCommerce."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:324
msgid "Order line item source mapping"
msgstr "Ramani ya chanzo cha kipengee cha orodha ya agizo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:334
msgid ""
"Normalize order line item product IDs to the source-language product at "
"checkout"
msgstr ""
"Sanifu nambari za bidhaa za orodha ya agizo kwa bidhaa ya lugha asili wakati "
"wa malipo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:338
msgid ""
"When enabled (recommended), the product ID stored on each WooCommerce order "
"line item is set to the source-language product. This ensures total_sales "
"counts, WC Analytics revenue rows, and third-party ERP exports reference one "
"product ID per SKU rather than one per language version. Trade-off: \"View "
"product\" links in order emails and My Account lead to the source-language "
"page. Disable only if a connected system relies on translated product IDs in "
"orders. Use the linguaforge_wc_order_item_source_mapping filter for per-item "
"overrides."
msgstr ""
"Wakati umewezeshwa (inapendekezwa), ID ya bidhaa iliyohifadhiwa kwenye kila "
"kipengee cha agizo cha WooCommerce huwekwa kwenye bidhaa ya lugha asili. Hii "
"inahakikisha hesabu za mauzo kamili, safu za mapato za WC Analytics, na "
"usafirishaji wa ERP wa mtu wa tatu unarejelea ID moja ya bidhaa kwa SKU "
"badala ya moja kwa kila toleo la lugha. Mabadiliko: viungo vya \"Tazama "
"bidhaa\" kwenye barua pepe za agizo na Akaunti Yangu hupelekea ukurasa wa "
"lugha asili. Zima tu ikiwa mfumo unaounganishwa unategemea IDs za bidhaa "
"zilizotafsiriwa kwenye maagizo. Tumia kichujio cha "
"linguaforge_wc_order_item_source_mapping kwa mabadiliko ya kila kipengee."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:350
msgid "Save Router Settings"
msgstr "Hifadhi Mipangilio ya Router"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:354
msgid "Flush Permalinks"
msgstr "Fanya usafi wa Permalinks"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:357
msgid ""
"Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific "
"slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the "
"primary language or adding new language support."
msgstr ""
"Inarejesha sheria za uandishi wa WordPress ili viambishi vya URL, slug za "
"lugha, na uandishi wa makala viwe vinaendana. Inahitajika baada ya "
"kubadilisha lugha kuu au kuongeza msaada wa lugha mpya."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:363
msgid "Flush Permalink Rules"
msgstr "Fanya usafi wa Sheria za Permalink"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:367
msgid "Active Languages"
msgstr "Lugha Zinazotumika"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:370
msgid ""
"Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress "
"locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs "
"in the section below to make more languages available for routing and "
"translation."
msgstr ""
